<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moody's assigns AAA rating to SMHL issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moody's assigns AAA rating to SMHL issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday it had assigned a AAA rating to the A$180 million of floating rate mortgage backed securities issued by the Superannuation Members' Home Loans (SMHL) Securitisation Fund No.4.</p>
<p>The ratings agency said the SMHL program is established by National Mutual Funds Management Ltd, a unit of National Mutual Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The issue also has a AAA rating from Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
